  "notes": "The generator basis is the odd-Y Pauli strings, because a real state needs a real orthogonal unitary and hence a real antisymmetric generator. The parity block records Motta's own right-hand side for both parities per configuration: the even-Y set contributes exactly zero, which is the mechanism of the failure the planning documents record for this method. The support scan is Motta's cost curve, the counterpart to varQITE's ansatz-depth curve in G-R.6.",
